        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ഏൽപ്പിക്കുക",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഏൽപ്പിക്കുക — ēlppikkuka — \"to entrust; to hand over (a task)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മാനേജർ പുതിയ ജോലി എന്നെ ഏൽപ്പിച്ചു. mānējar putiya jōli enne ēlppiccu. The manager entrusted the new work to me."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: ഏൽപ്പിച്ചു, ēlppiccu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person entrusted takes -എ; the task stays plain."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഏൽപ്പിക്കുക (ēlppikkuka) is native Dravidian: DEDR 905 lists ഏൽക്കുക, \"to receive, to take in charge\", and its causative, to make someone take it on (DEDR 905)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
